<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quanex Corp cut on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quanex Corp cut on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it downgraded Quanex Corp to buy-market outperformer from buy-focus on price.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 3/4 to 26-5/8.</p>
